ons via _run_atomic_op(plan, mutation, execute, budget_factory) and has ZERO references to coordinate_create, _resolve_ambiguous, or bind_confirm","search for 'coordinate_create' in coordinator.py returned (no matches); search for 'bind' in batch_dispatch.py returned (no matches)","The create lifecycle lives in create_coordinator.py (coordinate_create:235, _resolve_ambiguous:211) and create_route.py (coordinate_full_create:171), reached by a different route than coordinate_and_fuse"],"finding":"§2 claims driving coordinate_and_fuse for one throwaway plan exercises create/binding-lifecycle, coordinate_create's one-create-per-plan behavior, _resolve_ambiguous (create_coordinator.py:214), and bind_confirm — but coordinate_and_fuse routes to coordinator.coordinate, the NON-CREATE coordinator, which never invokes any of those. The create/commit-unknown/binding path is coordinate_full_create/coordinate_create in create_route.py/create_coordinator.py, which coordinate_and_fuse does not call. The mechanism as named cannot reach the code the AC requires.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"ff1bb4fa08f01b7a2","impact":1.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"§2 — Live-Cloud coordinator lifecycle module; ACs referencing coordinate_and_fuse + create/binding-lifecycle + commit-unknown","norm_id":"n553f75eb28cdd132","priority":0.9,"reason":"high-priority+criterion-opted-in","recalled":false,"scenarios":["The live module drives coordinate_and_fuse expecting a create outcome with bind_confirm and a commit-unknown adoption, but the non-create coordinator produces neither — the assertions cannot be satisfied, or the module silently exercises the wrong code path (a proxy) while claiming create/binding/commit-unknown coverage."],"severity":"critical","suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.9,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"yes","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"no","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_